@startuml deploy-sequence
title CI/CD — de push a main a contenedores corriendo en producción

actor Desarrollador as Dev
participant "GitHub Actions\n(job build-and-push)" as Build
participant "GHCR\n(ghcr.io)" as GHCR
participant "GitHub Actions\n(job deploy)" as Deploy
participant "VPS de producción" as VPS

Dev -> Build: push a main
activate Build
Build -> GHCR: docker login (GITHUB_TOKEN automático)
Build -> Build: docker build (6 servicios)
Build -> GHCR: docker push :latest y :<sha corto>
deactivate Build

Build -> Deploy: needs: build-and-push
activate Deploy
Deploy -> VPS: conexión SSH (appleboy/ssh-action)
activate VPS
VPS -> GHCR: docker compose pull
GHCR --> VPS: imágenes actualizadas
VPS -> VPS: docker compose up -d
VPS -> VPS: docker image prune -f
deactivate VPS
deactivate Deploy

@enduml
